# Paths that require review from the security reviewers team.
# NOTE: @acme-org/security-reviewers and @acme-org/platform-team are both
# placeholders; a repo admin must replace them with real GitHub teams that have
# write access to this repository. Until then GitHub reports an "unknown owner"
# error for these slugs on the CODEOWNERS check.

# Platform team owns everything under apps/ and team-apps/ stays unowned;
# the more specific security-reviewer patterns below still take precedence.
/apps/ @acme-org/platform-team

/packages/auth-guard/ @acme-org/security-reviewers
/packages/audit-log/ @acme-org/security-reviewers
# /.github/ also covers .github/removed-workspaces.json (sanctioned baseline
# removals). Per-package test-baseline.json files follow their package's owner.
/.github/ @acme-org/security-reviewers
/scripts/check-test-baselines.mjs @acme-org/security-reviewers
**/auth/** @acme-org/security-reviewers
**/crypto/** @acme-org/security-reviewers
